        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PSHPRA, Prairie Solid Brass 3-1/2\" x 12\" Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMeasuring 12\" high and 3-1/2\" wide, the Prairie Push Plate is cast in high quality brass and offered in your choice of 4 different beautiful finishes. The simple, flowing lines are modeled from designs often found in grassland states. Everything about this pushplate says simplistic beauty--a look, no doubt, that will stay popular for many years to come. This push plate is packaged with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur Nostalgic Warehouse Collection</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Prairie Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 5</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose on the outside, it will still be brass material on the inside.\r\n</p>",
